on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 16 ............................. <16>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <16>
  [  5] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(16)>
  [  8] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 11] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(16).visible = 1
  [ 14] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 17] pusharglist 1 ........................... <14>
  [ 19] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(14)>
  [ 22] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 25] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(14).visible = 1
  [ 28] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 31] pusharglist 1 ........................... <34>
  [ 33] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(34)>
  [ 36] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 39] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(34).visible = 1
  [ 42] ret
end
